# Aspect of Wolf's "Forests you control" are its controller's, not the enchanted creature's controller's (CR 109.5),
# and a Forest is any permanent with the Forest subtype as it is now (CR 305.6, 305.7, 611.3a). Bot1 enchants Bot2's
# Grizzly Bears (2/2) on turn 5 with Savannah, Tropical Island (nonbasic Forests) and a basic Forest - three Forests:
# +1/+2 makes it 3/4 (Bot2's two Forests would make it 3/3, all five 4/5, the basic Forest alone 2/3). On turn 7
# Spreading Seas makes Bot1's basic Forest an Island, no longer a Forest (CR 305.7): two Forests, +1/+1, 3/3.

